1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,916
In nineteen twenty four, Spemann and Mangold grafted a dorsal lip from one newt embryo onto the belly of another.

2
00:00:07,916 --> 00:00:10,364
The host grew a complete second embryo.

3
00:00:10,364 --> 00:00:13,281
The dorsal lip is the primary organiser.

4
00:00:13,281 --> 00:00:20,455
And one fact students get backwards: in the frog, the blastopore becomes the anus, not the mouth.

5
00:00:20,455 --> 00:00:23,776
Frogs, like us, are deuterostomes.

